{"root": {"children": [{"type": "html", "version": 1, "html": "<p>Code appears three ways, all in Fira Code — its ligatures (<code>=&gt;</code>, <code>!=</code>, <code>::</code>) render automatically.</p>
<h2>Inline</h2>
<p>Inline <code>code</code> sits in a sunken hairline chip; keyboard keys like <kbd>⌘</kbd> <kbd>S</kbd> get a key-cap treatment.</p>
<h2>Plain block</h2>
<pre><code>trigger AccountTrigger on Account (before insert) {
    AccountHandler.beforeInsert(Trigger.new);
}</code></pre>
